    <informations>Shelly RGBW2 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: W B G R GND DC I.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-rgbw2
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_5441b28b1fbbc6e155d9ba9fac7761c71b7d65e5b6a83735fff931c079af5933/image-20220920-071244.png?cb=bd69030595b83c90ca17440f109f9bd2
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_61a7d768a4d3127a7475fe4d900c7bedbaa743a495b66a25e2fd74bc8f3df4b0/White_led_bulb_shelly.png?cb=bb24b3f22e228acd940aac9e59e6c3e6
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_535b07d2911c48ae8177cec6d89c769b433c9ca399ab15a5e2286a80f690940c/User%20and%20Safety%20Guide?cb=49f92c8fa7219c1d5bd40b020286d0e0

Notes:
- Exact terminal order is printed at top of official User and Safety Guide, not inferred from old thumbnail. DC is the positive supply label.

Open points:
- Legacy KB lists Size 43mm x 38mm x 14mm without axis labels. W=43/H=38 is the conventional product-view interpretation.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
